#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:38
msgid ""
"To *subscribe* to a template event, we must create a *listener*, a template "
"file with exactly the same name as the identifier of the template event we "
"want to use, and place it in the ``event/`` subdirectory of a style’s "
"template folder."
msgstr ""
"To *subscribe* to a template event, we must create a *listener*, a template "
"file with exactly the same name as the identifier of the template event we "
"want to use, and place it in the ``event/`` subdirectory of a style’s "
"template folder."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_events.rst:42
msgid ""
